   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The two values of the future",
     "texto": [
      "**Temporal value of being later**: it refers to a fact that will happen later on: **Domani finiranno il progetto** (tomorrow they will finish the project).",
      "**Conjectural or epistemic value**: it makes a reasonable assumption about an unknown current situation: **Dov'è Paolo? — Sarà ancora in ufficio** (where is Paolo? — He's probably still in the office)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
